{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119195433962-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119210404\"/><p>救援人員即場為事主急救。</p><p>今晚(19日)7時18分，葵涌新都會廣場對開一小巴站，一名男子懷疑突然抽筋暈倒，由途人協助呼召救護車，再送往仁濟醫院搶救，可惜最終不治。</p><p>網上圖片顯示，事主戴上氧氣罩，並有救援人員跪在他的旁邊，輪流為其進行心外壓。其後，事主被抬上擔架床送醫。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:17:44.220360+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:54:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:31.717949+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:11:01.370690+00:00","content_hash":"bee7efeeacdb905d44289a3008e98372f3169e812c1e49c9c740026907fa4d33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}